# Default tuning applied to every build (Kokuban Kernel CI project razrfold_sm8845).
#
# The stages under Kokuban/tuning/ are cumulative and individually measurable; this
# entry point names the ones that are adopted. Every build is graded against
# Kokuban/abi/vmlinux.symvers.golden, so a stage that moves an exported symbol
# fails the build instead of shipping.
#
# See Kokuban/README.md for the per-stage ABI measurement results.

# I/O scheduler (ADIOS) and TCP congestion control (BBR, Brutal).
source tuning/00-base.fragment

# Low-latency queueing (CAKE, FQ_PIE, PIE).
source tuning/10-network.fragment
